Windowed, the window has its own size, window_width x window_height in the settings (1280 x 720 by default), and the
render scale follows its client height: set once a resize ends, not on each step of a drag, and kept for the next
start. Maximized, and in full screen, width x height (0 the desktop) applies as before.

